  "_comment": [
    "Cross-run invariant expectations for compositional routines (the skills",
    "send-render.yaml declares `compositional`). Consumed by",
    "operator/bin/lib/send_verify.py inside the daily send reconcile.",
    "",
    "HASHED ON PURPOSE. Both repos are public and the reconcile baseline",
    "already exposes recipient addresses; this file must not widen that",
    "surface. `recipients.<routine>` holds sha256('<routine>|<recipient",
    "lowercased>') hex digests; `ack_codes` maps sha256('<routine>|<item_key>')",
    "to the committed ack_code string (the code itself is a short opaque token",
    "the recipient already sees in mail, not PII).",
    "",
    "COMMITTED AND PR-UPDATED -- the reconcile-sends-baseline.json pattern.",
    "This repo takes no pushes to main, so committing an expectation is a",
    "reviewed act. A missing or corrupt file loads as the EMPTY expectation",
    "set, whose failure mode is over-reporting (every observed value proposed",
    "as new), never silence.",
    "",
    "FIRST COMMITTED 2026-09-09 from the scheduled reconcile's own PROPOSAL",
    "lines (run 34381188326 and a local replay of the same all-time scan):",
    "39 deadline-miss-escalator ack codes observed on pilot-smokeball across",
    "the 09-01..09-09 wakes, each item_key seen with exactly one code. From",
    "here a wake that carries a different code for one of these keys is the",
    "unstable-ACK finding; a key not listed is a new proposal. `recipients`",
    "stays empty until a compositional routine dispatches with a recipient",
    "stamp (none has yet)."
